{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id500580666"}, "name":{"label":"JT3105"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-15T07:11:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"14.17.0"}, "id":{"label":"14067320688"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointed"}, "content":{"label":"Agoda allows far too many low-quality accommodations that operate like scams to remain on their platform. They charge high extra fees without clearly stating them upfront. Even up to the final payment step, there is no notification or warning about these additional charges. The extra fees are carelessly mixed in with the main price in a way that is almost impossible to read.\nWhen customers contact Agoda’s customer service, the staff don’t seem to understand what the customer wants or what the actual problem is. They respond mechanically and always defend these scam-like properties.\nThis has been an extremely terrible experience with Agoda. I used to rate them very highly, but now I no longer do.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=440676901&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
