{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1054521615"}, "name":{"label":"phile1511"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-03T18:52:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"14.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"14025821251"}, "title":{"label":"Book a hotel room"}, "content":{"label":"I suspect a booking scam. Last night, between 11:30 PM and 11:45 PM, I made a booking. I selected check-in on May 5th and check-out on May 6th, then paid and received a confirmation email stating the check-in dates were incorrect: May 3rd and check-out on May 4th. However, it was already 11 PM on May 3rd, so how could I have checked in? I called the hotel, but they only received the email from Agoda at midnight. There must be a system issue. When I contacted Agoda, I couldn't reach anyone for support and was only directed to speak to the WhatsApp AI, resulting in my money being lost.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=440676901&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
