{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1284267453"}, "name":{"label":"Thi Thu Bo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-01T01:50:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"14.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"14015667563"}, "title":{"label":"1⭐ – Very poor customer service"}, "content":{"label":"I am extremely disappointed with Agoda.\n\nI had a confirmed booking, but when we arrived at the hotel, we were unable to access the room because no entry code was provided.\n\nWe contacted Agoda support immediately, but they only told us to wait and did not provide any real assistance while we were stuck outside for over 2 hours in cold weather.\n\nAs a result, my family had to leave and pay for transportation to go back home during the night.\n\nThis situation shows a serious lack of responsibility and support for customers.\n\nA booking platform should ensure that customers can actually check in safely.\n\nVery bad experience. I would not trust Agoda again.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=440676901&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
